#: src/remmina.c:451
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Examples:\n"
"To connect using an existing connection profile, use:\n"
"\n"
"\tunidesk -cFILE.remmina\n"
"\n"
"To quick connect using a URI:\n"
"\n"
"\tunidesk -crdp://username@server\n"
"\tunidesk -crdp://domain\\\\username@server\n"
"\tunidesk -cssh://user@server\n"
"\tunidesk -ctelnet://user@server\n"
"\n"
"To quick connect and name the connection\n"
"\n"
"\tunidesk -cssh://user@server%connection_name\n"
"\n"
"To quick connect using a URI along with an encrypted password:\n"
"\n"
"\tunidesk -crdp://username:encrypted-password@server\n"
"\tunidesk -cssh://username:encrypted-password@server\n"
"\n"
"To encrypt a password for use with a URI:\n"
"\n"
"\tunidesk --encrypt-password\n"
"\n"
"To update username and password and set a different resolution mode of a "
"UniDeskBrowser connection profile, use:\n"
"\n"
"\techo \"username\\napassword\" | unidesk --update-profile /PATH/TO/FOO."
"remmina --set-option username --set-option resolution_mode=2 --set-option "
"password\n"
msgstr ""
"Примеры:\n"
"Подключение по существующему профилю:\n"
"\n"
"\tunidesk -cFILE.remmina\n"
"\n"
"Быстрое подключение по URI:\n"
"\n"
"\tunidesk -crdp://username@server\n"
"\tunidesk -crdp://domain\\\\username@server\n"
"\tunidesk -cssh://user@server\n"
"\tunidesk -ctelnet://user@server\n"
"\n"
"Быстрое подключение с именем подключения:\n"
"\n"
"\tunidesk -cssh://user@server%connection_name\n"
"\n"
"Быстрое подключение по URI с зашифрованным паролем:\n"
"\n"
"\tunidesk -crdp://username:encrypted-password@server\n"
"\tunidesk -cssh://username:encrypted-password@server\n"
"\n"
"Зашифровать пароль для использования в URI:\n"
"\n"
"\tunidesk --encrypt-password\n"
"\n"
"Обновить имя пользователя и пароль и задать другой режим разрешения в "
"профиле подключения UniDeskBrowser:\n"
"\n"
"\techo \"username\\napassword\" | unidesk --update-profile /PATH/TO/FOO."
"remmina --set-option username --set-option resolution_mode=2 --set-option "
"password\n"

